			<item>
				<title>David Navara - Nodirbek Yakubboev (Praag, 2026)</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/okra/games/navara/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 18 Mar 2026 10:21:29 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/okra/games/navara/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;De meest spectaculaire partij van Praag, 2026 was zonder enige twijfel het treffen tussen David Navara en Nodirbek Yakubboev.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;!--&#xA;.yt 03QyvYHyPCQ&#xA;--&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/03QyvYHyPCQ?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Je kan de video ook bekijken op &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/kprq7nleu2ec72nn0jfae/The_Entire_Chess_World_Is_Reeling_Over_This_Immo.mp4?rlkey=2lwxn031qaciuekonfsck7jhj&amp;amp;dl=0&#34;&gt;dropbox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;!--&#xA;.game game.pgn&#xA;--&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- Game begin --&gt;&#xA;&lt;link href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/okra/js/lichess/pgn/lichess-pgn-viewer.css&#34; type=&#34;text/css&#34; rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;style&gt;&#xA;    body {&#xA;         background: var(--demo-bg, #161512);&#xA;      --board-color: #f1e14e;&#xA;      margin: 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;game&#34;&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;script type=&#34;module&#34;&gt;&#xA;    import { ViewPGN } from &#34;/okra/js/lichess/pgn/one.js&#34;;&#xA;    ViewPGN(&#34;game.pgn&#34;, &#34;game&#34;);&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- Game end --&gt;</description>
